{"title":"Ethiopia update","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/971194007/0/marginalrevolution~Ethiopia-update.html","date":1791563044000,"content":"<blockquote><p><span>Ethiopia is the </span><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack.com%2Fredirect%2F0212e091-b838-441f-8472-42349ac3f842%3Fj%3DeyJ1IjoiM285In0.FYORq_H-OKLpmdRjBukHHZzTJ6NOFfwRxYngojeKDOQ&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctcowen%40gmu.edu%7C2c53fad7b99b492a641608df25ee7163%7C9e857255df574c47a0c00546460380cb%7C0%7C0%7C639271378266861035%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=qEsbs%2BIOjbMXlmcsEpouPQdOuoZ3OTaDtrEhiKpKtUQ%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">center of the world right now</a> as it has <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack.com%2Fredirect%2Fbe66c4e1-9e00-4e97-9878-f80bcadd4c36%3Fj%3DeyJ1IjoiM285In0.FYORq_H-OKLpmdRjBukHHZzTJ6NOFfwRxYngojeKDOQ&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctcowen%40gmu.edu%7C2c53fad7b99b492a641608df25ee7163%7C9e857255df574c47a0c00546460380cb%7C0%7C0%7C639271378266886474%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=ju%2F1MvxE998QIJ6O5PLxhlHPzAfUtotZDOKobPBofmo%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">returned to war</a>. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack.com%2Fredirect%2F5f30a80e-1df3-456b-b42b-ca28446822e5%3Fj%3DeyJ1IjoiM285In0.FYORq_H-OKLpmdRjBukHHZzTJ6NOFfwRxYngojeKDOQ&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctcowen%40gmu.edu%7C2c53fad7b99b492a641608df25ee7163%7C9e857255df574c47a0c00546460380cb%7C0%7C0%7C639271378266906497%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=A%2BMIdQJiXPAjMk5c8aNe4Up6Z%2BGNyE75ASSU4cyNcqs%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">Ethiopian forces retook Mekelle</a> from <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack.com%2Fredirect%2F2408d171-d6a0-4225-a6e7-4f6310320d37%3Fj%3DeyJ1IjoiM285In0.FYORq_H-OKLpmdRjBukHHZzTJ6NOFfwRxYngojeKDOQ&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctcowen%40gmu.edu%7C2c53fad7b99b492a641608df25ee7163%7C9e857255df574c47a0c00546460380cb%7C0%7C0%7C639271378266925388%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=YV078Nf34T6rdBD3tz8629H4kt1SSJwIJBD9g8pq6LM%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">rebel forces</a>, but the <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack.com%2Fredirect%2Fa745a6e7-d602-4fae-ac26-5c92461aa961%3Fj%3DeyJ1IjoiM285In0.FYORq_H-OKLpmdRjBukHHZzTJ6NOFfwRxYngojeKDOQ&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctcowen%40gmu.edu%7C2c53fad7b99b492a641608df25ee7163%7C9e857255df574c47a0c00546460380cb%7C0%7C0%7C639271378266944440%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=hxTBXkprqwazQtG%2BTfPwh0AcbDrbbCtr5w6Q%2BZCtO1E%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">fighting has extended beyond Tigray</a>. Eritrean forces allegedly <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack.com%2Fredirect%2F5a9caaf2-08dc-45fd-bfe9-2a3c4085dfdc%3Fj%3DeyJ1IjoiM285In0.FYORq_H-OKLpmdRjBukHHZzTJ6NOFfwRxYngojeKDOQ&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctcowen%40gmu.edu%7C2c53fad7b99b492a641608df25ee7163%7C9e857255df574c47a0c00546460380cb%7C0%7C0%7C639271378266963061%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=tuw4JFIjrorieWmp2%2FPv34uiG3C46JSMp8m9aY3nbLc%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">entered Tigray</a>, and <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack.com%2Fredirect%2F1001c044-a6b0-4837-83ce-234bc9eec023%3Fj%3DeyJ1IjoiM285In0.FYORq_H-OKLpmdRjBukHHZzTJ6NOFfwRxYngojeKDOQ&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctcowen%40gmu.edu%7C2c53fad7b99b492a641608df25ee7163%7C9e857255df574c47a0c00546460380cb%7C0%7C0%7C639271378266985132%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=NAFXI%2FniVpA9WyE6PlLKaa6gN0pCw5czdfDXfMIA6qo%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">Ethiopia responded with drone attacks</a>. The <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack.com%2Fredirect%2Fd2908093-b125-48d0-aba1-02f8a2924840%3Fj%3DeyJ1IjoiM285In0.FYORq_H-OKLpmdRjBukHHZzTJ6NOFfwRxYngojeKDOQ&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctcowen%40gmu.edu%7C2c53fad7b99b492a641608df25ee7163%7C9e857255df574c47a0c00546460380cb%7C0%7C0%7C639271378267004546%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=D9eESTrATVzOmFbsVfbf3KPVw9zeedac8SXTrSW%2BZrA%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">war could go a number of ways</a>. The <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack.com%2Fredirect%2F0c9286f2-7e35-40f6-9e81-b508bbee7d01%3Fj%3DeyJ1IjoiM285In0.FYORq_H-OKLpmdRjBukHHZzTJ6NOFfwRxYngojeKDOQ&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctcowen%40gmu.edu%7C2c53fad7b99b492a641608df25ee7163%7C9e857255df574c47a0c00546460380cb%7C0%7C0%7C639271378267023102%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=DeuBYCfSxjeCfrxcb23WVHAc0%2FkFeS%2FQ1fNPX5KZw6Y%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">war extends beyond Ethiopia</a>. Sara Al-Saeed <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack.com%2Fredirect%2F63a50750-447c-4436-914b-83d69ca66a4f%3Fj%3DeyJ1IjoiM285In0.FYORq_H-OKLpmdRjBukHHZzTJ6NOFfwRxYngojeKDOQ&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctcowen%40gmu.edu%7C2c53fad7b99b492a641608df25ee7163%7C9e857255df574c47a0c00546460380cb%7C0%7C0%7C639271378267047183%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=On%2Fh95pnqB8IUlKRsNFvytyS3A7KUFUwr72i%2FyNNCtc%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">explains</a> how Egypt extended its rivalry with Ethiopia <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack.com%2Fredirect%2F4de12185-d957-448c-8616-f644b8b80c9d%3Fj%3DeyJ1IjoiM285In0.FYORq_H-OKLpmdRjBukHHZzTJ6NOFfwRxYngojeKDOQ&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctcowen%40gmu.edu%7C2c53fad7b99b492a641608df25ee7163%7C9e857255df574c47a0c00546460380cb%7C0%7C0%7C639271378267067000%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=cC5%2FV7cLXWMS0tU6BjQn%2FJp%2BiAu7fUqUR7cTnLiMCn4%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">across the Horn of Africa</a>. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack.com%2Fredirect%2F6794a2d8-5821-4777-b421-308a6c7fb82b%3Fj%3DeyJ1IjoiM285In0.FYORq_H-OKLpmdRjBukHHZzTJ6NOFfwRxYngojeKDOQ&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctcowen%40gmu.edu%7C2c53fad7b99b492a641608df25ee7163%7C9e857255df574c47a0c00546460380cb%7C0%7C0%7C639271378267085232%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;s